  <name>VitaSuwayomi</name>
  <summary>Suwayomi manga reader for desktop and consoles</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      VitaSuwayomi is a native Suwayomi/Tachiyomi client built on borealis. It
      browses your library and sources, reads chapters, and manages downloads
      with a controller-friendly interface.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Library, sources and extension management</li>
      <li>Paged and webtoon reading modes</li>
      <li>Downloads for offline reading</li>
      <li>Reading history and statistics</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
